<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>84% success rate at 170 fps according to online superglide trainer 

At lower fps, change delay to 2ms.

To use this superglide macro, simply climb any object and then press the hotkey that you have bound the macro to. 
I press V for example, at the peak of my climb.

Also, make sure you bind your second Crouch HOLD bind  to J</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 44 1
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 1 ms
KeyDown 13 1
KeyUp 13 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>